relation (16.6), and the exact critical world $W_3$ of Definition 13.1.
Write $y_3=(p_3,v_3)=\Phi(W_3)$. By Lemma 13.2,
$y_3\in\operatorname{int}K_3$ and $p_3\ne24$. For $y\in\widehat K_3$,
